---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../lib/site_config.js';
---

<Layout
  title="About Cosmetiqly — Independent Formulation Safety Analysis"
  description="Learn about Cosmetiqly: our mission to provide transparent, citation-backed INCI cosmetic ingredient analysis, our editorial review process, and data provenance."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-slate-900">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-slate-700 font-medium">About</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-slate-200">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800 block mb-1">
        About Cosmetiqly
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-slate-900 font-semibold tracking-tight">
        Independent Formulation Analysis
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        Building the most transparent, citation-backed cosmetic safety database on the open web.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          Cosmetic marketing is filled with vague claims like &ldquo;clean,&rdquo; &ldquo;dermatologist-tested,&rdquo; and &ldquo;hypoallergenic&rdquo;&mdash;terms that lack standardized legal definitions in major jurisdictions. Consumers dealing with specific dermatological conditions (such as Malassezia folliculitis, contact dermatitis, pregnancy restrictions, or acne vulgaris) need objective facts, not slogans.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Cosmetiqly was founded to cut through the marketing noise by providing structured, deterministic INCI ingredient reviews backed by published medical research, peer-reviewed clinical studies, and institutional toxicological reports.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Our Data Integrity Standard</h2>
        <p>
          Unlike legacy directories that generate synthetic product names or recycle stock ingredient pools, every single product analyzed on Cosmetiqly is sourced from authentic physical packaging scans via the Open Beauty Facts repository under the Open Database Licence (ODbL).
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We believe trust is earned through complete transparency:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-600">
          <li><strong>No Fake Review Badges:</strong> We do not display fictitious user ratings, invented review counters, or commercial certifications.</li>
          <li><strong>Real Barcodes:</strong> Every product record preserves its official European Article Number (EAN) or Universal Product Code (UPC) barcode, enabling instant external verification.</li>
          <li><strong>Exact INCI Lists:</strong> We publish the complete, unaltered ingredient breakdown alongside our rule evaluations.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="p-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-[#fbfbf9]">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Editorial Supervision</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mb-3 leading-relaxed">
          The algorithmic rule definitions, literature citations, and data normalization pipelines at Cosmetiqly are maintained and supervised by:
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">
          <span class="font-semibold text-sm text-slate-900 block">{SITE_CONFIG.reviewerName}</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 block">{SITE_CONFIG.reviewerTitle}</span>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2">
            Specializing in health informatics, computational taxonomy, and chemical compliance data structures. Responsible for maintaining the accuracy of our 15 cited rule blacklists and continuous Open Beauty Facts synchronization.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Correction Mechanism &amp; Community Feedback</h2>
        <p>
          Cosmetic formulations evolve. Brands frequently update formulations, replace preservatives, or alter fragrance components without modifying external product names. When packaging discrepancies arise, we provide a public correction path:
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-600">
          If you discover an out-of-date or inaccurate INCI list, visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-emerald-800 underline">Contact &amp; Corrections page</a> and submit a photograph of the physical packaging ingredient panel. Our team verifies and updates records within 72 hours.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
